<statement>
<p>
In this course we will be primarily concerned with which of the following?</p>
<p><ol style="list-style-type:upper-alpha"><li>Experimental probability</li> 
<li>Theoretical probability</li> 
<li>Descriptive probability</li> 
<li>Distributive probability</li> 
<li>Inferential probability</li> 
<li>Subjective probability</li> 
<li>None of the above</li> 
</ol></p>


</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li>B: Theoretical probability</li></ul></p>
</answer>

